{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1742212730_4072036_bc1e75f72bc47bb526e63d3e79fff00d.jpg",
  "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">At Nara, the focus is on crafting swimwear that transcends trends. Offering classic shapes and cuts that flatter all body types. We are deeply inspired by the beauty of nature, and you will see this come through our prints and colour selections.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Our mission is to create pieces that are not only visually captivating, but also ethically produced.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">With a focus on sustainability, we are making as many of our prints reversible, as possible! We're all about embracing the beauty of choice and versatility, while reducing waste.</span></p>",
